      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-148023",
      ":question/problem": "The joint CDF of two continuous random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given by\n\n$F(x, y) = {0,\\begin{vmatrix}x < 0ory < 0 \\\\ (1 - e^{-3x})y^{2},\\end{vmatrix}x \\ge 0, 0 \\le y \\le 1; F_{X}(x), \\mid x \\ge 0, y > 1$.\n\nFind $F_{Y}(y)$, the marginal CDF of $Y$, for $y \\ge 0$."
